          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आज़माना — āzmānā — \"to try out, to test\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर यह दवा काम नहीं करेगी तो डाक्टर दूसरी दवा आज़माएगा। agar yah davā kām nahīṃ karegī to ḍākṭar dūsrī davā āzmāegā. If this medicine doesn't work, the doctor will try another one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने नई दवा आज़माई, usne naī davā āzmāī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आज़माना (āzmānā) is usually traced to Persian āzmā-, \"test\". This is the stem of āzmūdan, \"to test\"."
            }
          ]
        },
